Z||000002||Camaro_hunter_d||08-30-2001||07:30 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by samoht:<BR><B>it takes a whole lot to get anything out of a 2.8/3.1..   I cant name one thing that helped alot.. start with cam and air intake, then go to exhaust...  Good luck ... my best advise.. buy a Z28</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE> <P>  If I wanted an 8 I'd put one in. I do not want an 8. I want a 6. However I am planning on a 4.3 turbo build this winter to swap into the car. I just wanted a little something for now. I am planning on geting roughly 550 ponies at 29 PSI with this 4.3.<P>||||reg||1
