Z||000006||Camaro_hunter_d||08-31-2001||12:46 AM||||well I was thinking NOS but that just helps for a few seconds...I really need to get this freggin metal working equip. I plan On making a mini ram air set up for the 3.1 and switch to "spintle" style injectors that are angled to fire right into the intake valve.<BR>  I plan on making the runners 1 by 1.75 inches and mount the injectors at the base in the middle of the bend tat turns into the head port. And I plan on using the twin 52MM throttle bodies of the TPI 350's, that are so plentiful in the bone yards. I am hoping to get roughtly 25-30 HP from that alone. And of course after that I have pics of the Hooker headers they made for the 3.1 so I can use those pics as a guide to remake them in limited numbers.  have been told by the few that have gotten them they picked up a good 20 ponies I dunno that for fact but would not doubt it.<BR>  So whats left after that you ask? a turbo set up using junk yard turbos from mopar, ford... Yes after I get the headers done and a few sold I plan on making turbo headers and cross piping. And if I get into it a intercooler set up too... Man I need money!.||||reg||1
